# `public/` must stay in the context: nginx serves the self-hosted Monaco tree from
# `public/monaco/vs` (`audit M7`), and the CSP in nginx.conf only holds because Monaco is
# same-origin.
#
# `scripts/` must stay in the context: package.json runs `node scripts/copy-monaco.mjs`
# before build.

# Build artifacts & caches
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.vite/
.eslintcache
*.tsbuildinfo
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
**/.eslintcache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

